# Check out every text file with LF line endings on every OS.
#
# GitHub's Windows runners (and most Windows Git installs) default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which turns the shipped mods/ww2 TOML into CRLF on
# checkout. The content tests edit those files with "\n"-based patterns
# (e.g. s7_schema_errors_are_reported), so they fail on Windows only.
* text=auto eol=lf
